.DS_Store
STATUS.md
Brief.md
docs/dross.pdf

# dross handoff — local working memory, not tracked
.dross/handoff.md

# dross machine-local values (quick_base) — deliberately untracked: state.json
# rides the squash onto the base, so a value stored there would be dragged
# forward into every later tree. Staying out of history is the whole point.
.dross/local.toml

# dross machine-local position + version state — deliberately untracked: a
# checkout of a branch carrying a stale copy would otherwise replace the live
# one, and git cannot overwrite what it does not track (locked state_tracking)
.dross/state.json

# dross security run artifacts — local audit output; never pre-disclose on a public repo
.dross/security/

# dross quality run artifacts — local audit output; the committed record is the remediation spec
.dross/quality/

# dross tech-debt run artifacts — local scan output; state.toml is the durable signal, run dirs are prunable
.dross/techdebt/
